nina: quick note from QA: our published SDK examples still show re-requesting the whole paginator page on transient failures. gateway now returns x-resume-token so clients can resume inside a page. can we add a tiny, copy-pasteable pattern for py/ts/go that shows resume + bounded retries?
oscar: ill take TS + a small helper util. will show async iterator + resume hook.
lee: i can do Python and Go; will provide a shared docs helper for python and a compact Go example that uses channels for streamed chunks.
